{"created": "2016-05-18T16:21:15+00:00", "modified": "2019-04-10T03:44:27.755297+00:00", "id": 48654, "conceptrecid": "631943", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.48654", "conceptdoi": "", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.48654", "metadata": {"title": "The imprint on the cosmic microwave background (CMB) of Bianchi cosmologies", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.48654", "publication_date": "2016-03-26", "description": "<p>These animations display the imprint that homogeneous but anisotropic Bianchi models induce in the cosmic microwave background (CMB).</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>scalars_movie.mp4 : Bianchi VIIh/VII0 scalar modes, imprint on the CMB for varying morphology parameters (matter and dark-energy density, rotation scale of shear principal axes)</p>\n\n<p>vectors_movie.mp4: Bianchi VIIh/VII0 vector modes, imprint on the CMB for varying morphology parameters (matter and dark-energy density, rotation scale of shear principal axes)</p>\n\n<p>tensor_movie.mp4: Bianchi VIIh/VII0 regular tensor modes, imprint on the CMB for varying morphology parameters (matter and dark-energy density, rotation scale of shear principal axes)</p>\n\n<p>Additional fixed parameters for the three animations above:<br />\ncold-dark-matter physical density: 0.112<br />\nbaryon physical density: 0.226<br />\nPattern orientation additionally fixed to put spiral in full view</p>\n\n<p>_____________________________</p>\n\n<p>SVTT_movie.mp4: combinations of Bianchi VIIh/VII0 scalar, vector, regular and irregular tensor modes for varying relative amplitudes of these degrees of freedom and phase angle.</p>\n\n<p>Additional fixed parameters:<br />\ncold-dark-matter physical density: 0.112<br />\nbaryon physical density 0.0226<br />\nmatter density: 0.27<br />\ndark energy density: 0.7<br />\nrotation scale of shear principal axes: 0.5<br />\nPattern orientation additionally fixed to put spiral in full view</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Daniela Saadeh", "affiliation": "University College London"}, {"name": "Stephen M. Feeney", "affiliation": "Imperial College London"}, {"name": "Andrew Pontzen", "affiliation": "University College London"}, {"name": "Hiranya V. Peiris", "affiliation": "University College London"}, {"name": "Jason D. McEwen", "affiliation": "Mullard Space Science Laboratory"}], "keywords": ["Cosmology", "CMB", "isotropy", "Bianchi"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.48653", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "scheme": "doi"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Video/Audio", "type": "video"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "astronomy-general"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "631943"}}]}}, "title": "The imprint on the cosmic microwave background (CMB) of Bianchi cosmologies", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/48654", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/48654", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/48654?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.48654", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.48654", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.48654", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/48654/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/631943", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/631943", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:48654/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:48654/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/48654/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/48654/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/48654/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/48654/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/48654/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/48654/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4865